# Medium mutation rules (~40) for hashcat (-r).
# A middle tier between wifi-rules-fast.rule (~11) and the full rule set
# (~161). Covers the mutations people actually apply to a base password:
# capitalise, append 2-6 digit sequences, years 2018-2025, leet, and
# capitalise+digit combos. Bigger coverage than "fast" while still fitting a
# generous per-stage budget on a single network.
# c=Capitalize u=UPPER l=lower $x=append ^x=prepend sXY=substitute
c
u
l
